Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortieth Episode\NThe Hunt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,His Most Excellent Majesty,\Nthe King of Terra Verde!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That King is the most majestic\Nof those who have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He might even manage to win\Nthe hunting tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what a beautiful prize!\NAnd how it shines!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it's made of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful, a suit of golden armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever proves to be\Nthe best of the tournament will win it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty, the King of Forgland!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,His Lordship, Lord Lampski!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Their Royal Highnesses, the Bokeron\Nbrothers of the Kingdom of Bokeron!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His Grace, Duke Dolcon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness, Prince\NFranz of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, how wonderful!\N- How kind and strong he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish he would win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His Most Excellent Grace,\Nthe Grand Duke of Vosgaria!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I wear this dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,... maybe this other one is better?\NAnd what do you think of this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How can anyone spend\Nhours trying on clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be an extremely interesting\Ncompetition, Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you Duke Duralumin?\N- Yes, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I belong to Union X.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:04:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to ask you\Na big favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our gift for you.\NI earnestly ask you to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Prince Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But really, will you tell me\Nwhy Sapphire is taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess\Nis choosing her dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling I'm going to wear\Nthis very dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Franz!\NWelcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Franz! How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a joke!\NPrince Franz isn't here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!\NStop making fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!\NI just wanted to play a joke on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Franz...!\NHow are you now? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes!\N- Thank you for inviting me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- The signal!\N- Platoon, roll the drums!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz,\Nwhat a pleasure to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your horse is magnificent,\Nhowever word is going around...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...that the horses of Goldland\Nare not well-trained...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...and don't know how to gallop, even\Nif they look magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s not true!\NThat is just a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s try to have a\Nlittle race to the swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right, I accept!\N- Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I won’t\Nlose! I’m ready, Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!\NThe trick worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it’s your turn, my falcon.\NGo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Look, a falcon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But those are Franz\Nand Lord Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid the Baron is\Nup to one of his tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, deer friend,\NI want to follow them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The swamp is to the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This road leads to the\Ncemetery! Now it's in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Alarm! Warn Gagoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- The black falcon is coming!\N- Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's happening?\N- The black falcon has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The signal! There's the signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaves!\NTo work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange! There is no swamp\Nhere! This is a cemetery!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see?\NI am the most skilled hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir!\NI am the most skilled hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I am the most skilled! Look\Nat how much game I caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?! Then look at\Nwhat a huge beast I captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- I won!\N- No, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- How come Franz isn't coming back?\N- Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz has lost the challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- And where is he?\N- Can you imagine it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After losing, he cowardly\Nran away to Goldland in tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's truly a spineless weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of the fool he made\Nof himself in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I really enjoyed myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too! It's been a long time since we've had a hunt like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a truly fine hunter, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You too! You too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It was truly exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- But there is one thing that worries me!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know the Union, but I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?! The Union?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible! Sooner or later they will arrive in our country too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Every tree, every blade of grass, will be hexed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And people will go around desperately looking for food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Union X will arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Its members will burn our houses...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...and kill the people without mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All this will happen in a very short time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems they are in possession of many weapons so lethal...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...that our imagination cannot conceive of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus they will make a desert around us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And after the destruction they will provide food to the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but this food will contain a drug...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...that will take away from man every power of thought and struggle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That way we will all end up\Nworking in the service of Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Union X is a horrible clique!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's terrible!\N- It's truly incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What he says is true! I've\Nalready heard about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...from a neighbor of mine\Nbefore he disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But then we are in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, if he were right,\Nit would be truly serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you think?\N- It's worrying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, I don't believe\Nwhat Baron Nylon said!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But where could you\Nbe now? If only I knew..!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, Prince Frank\Nis in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He has been kidnapped\Nby a mysterious old woman..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...in a cemetery,\Nbeyond the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Show me the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When this boy dies
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we will have no trouble\Nseizing Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.46,0:13:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When the underground empire\Nis completed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...we will easily crush\NSilverland too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You are awake,\Nbut you will be for only a short while,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,because this time\Nyou will fall asleep forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing?\N- Look up! Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There are fifty tons\Nof iron hanging from a rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And that rope will break\Nin about half an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:14:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That way you'll have time to enjoy yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did it happen here, Tink?\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for a clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This place looks\Nvery sinister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is coming!\NAway!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think I heard a voice.\N- Maybe you imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows where\Nthis opening leads...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They have built a fortress\Nunderground!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.94,0:15:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Don't be afraid, Tink. I will help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is coming, hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tink, but if\Nthey catch me now, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A human!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Move! Work or it\Nwill be worse for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.46,0:17:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up! Did you hear\Nme? Get up, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected!\NThis is the X Union...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...that Lord Fougwarf\Ntold us about!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.02,0:17:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They have captured people\Nfrom other countries...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...and they make\Nthem work as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! For you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have taken Franz too,\Nbut where are they keeping him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, where are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what were you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You must speak! Confess!\NConfess, you shrimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not a shrimp,\NI am Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter!\NTell me who you came with!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly couldn't\Nhave come alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:18:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink?! Boy, aren't you the one\Nwho is always following Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't follow Sapphire,\NI am his assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire! We can\Nkill two birds with one stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch Franz closely!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill every suspicious person\Nyou encounter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! As for you, shrimp,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.90,0:18:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I will stop you from being\Nimpertinent with me ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If that child wanted to choose\Na suitable place to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,he couldn't have found\Na better place!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- The captain wants to speak with you!\N- Yes, let's go right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz, it's me!\N- Sapphire, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, please!\NThis is the Union X Fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Franz!\NI came to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't show yourself\Nor they will kill you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not an ordinary girl,\Nyou know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:19:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get away!\N- But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! I didn't call you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, the one who\Ntold you that is Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He entered the base with\Nthe crumb! Let's look for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Save yourself, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.02,0:19:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!\NHe's still tied up tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But where is that damn spy\Ndisguised as a member of Union X?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here I am!\N- Where is he? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:20:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- A masked knight!\N- I've come to save you, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Masked or not, let's kill him!\N- Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! The alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a spy in the Fortress!\NKill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Quick, let's catch her!\N- Yes, let's go! Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, you saved\Nmy life, masked knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink is in their hands!\N- I'm following you! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who is that masked knight?\N- Whoever he is, he doesn't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,\Nhe'll come to a bad end!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.82,0:21:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- But that...\N- So you are with them too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly! The King\Nof Blackland is in Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.82,0:21:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's lure them into the central cave!\NIt will be easier to fight them there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't let them escape!\N- Forward! Let's get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- We have come to free you!\N- What?! A masked knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.78,0:21:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come\Nto destroy Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The masked knight is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the moment we've been\Nwaiting for! Let's destroy Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, the slaves\Nare rebelling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where are you going?\N- Handle it yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I must return to my kingdom,\NI have too much to do there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.26,0:22:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.02,0:22:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You will all die like rats!\NToo bad for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The underground empire will collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Masked knight!\NPrince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- This way!\N- It's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Quickly! Or we will be crushed!\N- Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.62,0:23:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Quick, let's escape!\N- Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.22,0:24:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That masked knight\Nhas spoiled our plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.66,0:24:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He has thwarted\Nthe plans of Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Union X\Ndoes not give up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we will conquer Silverland\Nand we will rule over that land too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.62,0:24:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So Union X\Nwas not an imaginary danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, whatever\Nshould happen to Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- I will always run to your aid!\N- I thank you with all my heart, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.34,0:24:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all truly very grateful to you\Nfor helping us! Thank you, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.90,0:24:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! May God bless you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.58,0:24:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I am really confused!
